{{PAGENAME}} is a [[Curiosity]] which can be used in the [[Study Report]] to earn [[Learning Points]].

{{PAGENAME}} can randomly appear from any fire source. And when working with fire - dropping a [[Pyrite Spark]], extinguishing a fire, accessing lit smelters, and similar activities.

==Notes==

*Irrlights can be used to instantly light fire or workstations.
*Irrlights will float through [[Fence|fencing]] but will bounce off of cave walls.
*Delayed spawning: Offloaded map-parts, with active fires, can spawn multiple irrlights at the same time when re-entering that map-part.

